The header's serial port off in this boot: `enable_uart=0`, no `dtoverlay=uart0…` or `dtparam=uart0` line, and no
`console=serial0` word on the kernel command line. Under kernel 6.18 JTAG cannot run otherwise ([why](/boards/acorn/checks/jtag-and-the-pcie-endpoint.md#why-a-blade-needs-its-serial-port-off-for-jtag)); under kernel 6.12 it also answers with the serial port on. In the serial-off boot there is no serial pair to test.
